<div class="outline-text-3" id="text-org3a893eb">
<p>
Added transient menu interface
</p>

<p>
Introduced a comprehensive transient menu (<code>dired-video-thumbnail-transient</code>) providing quick access to all commands via <code>.</code> or <code>C-c .</code> in the thumbnail buffer. The menu displays current state (sort order, filters, video count, recursive/wrap mode) and organises commands into logical groups: Navigation, Playback, Sorting, Filtering, Marking, Delete, Display, and Other.
</p>
</div>
</div>
<div id="outline-container-org0973ac2" class="outline-3">
