<div class="outline-text-3" id="text-org0973ac2">
<p>
Enhanced package with sorting, filtering, and docs
</p>

<p>
Added sorting and filtering features to <code>dired-video-thumbnail</code>. Introduced customizable options for sorting and filtering criteria, and implement interactive commands for toggling these settings. Included comprehensive documentation in Texinfo format, covering installation, usage, and customization.
</p>
